# Local development variables for `wrangler dev` (copy to .dev.vars — git-ignored).
#
# Nothing secret is required: the Worker only uses platform bindings declared in wrangler.jsonc
#   AI     — Workers AI (chat + "Explain it")
#   EMAIL  — send_email via Cloudflare Email Routing (contact form)
#   KV     — rate limits, chat leads, explain cache
#   ASSETS — the static Astro build in ./dist
#
# Non-secret vars live in wrangler.jsonc → "vars". Override any of them here for local testing:
# SITE_URL=http://localhost:8787
# CONTACT_TO=you@example.com
